  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/banner.gif\" alt=\"火把攻击！横幅\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=26.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"加载器\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/server.svg\" alt=\"覆盖层\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"问题\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/torch-hit/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><hr><h2>📝 <strong>描述</strong></h2><p>探索洞穴时你面临选择：要么在副手拿火把照亮四周，要么持盾抵御怪物攻击。<br>\n有了这个模组，你再也不必纠结！火把将赋予你战斗优势！<br>\n手持火把时，你可以点燃敌人，让探索更轻松，或作为火焰附加附魔的早期替代品。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252ftorch-hit%253fref%253dcrystal-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/minecraft-storage-banner.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage\"></a></p><h2>⚙️ <strong>兼容性</strong></h2><p>兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Fire'd</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Fire</a> 以及任何模组添加的火把！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/soul-hit.gif\" alt=\"灵魂火把攻击\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/mod-hit.gif\" alt=\"模组火把攻击\"><br>\n此外，若模组火把与 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prometheus</a></strong> 兼容，使用它攻击将点燃对应类型的火焰！</p><h2>✨ <strong>特性</strong></h2><ul>\n<li>主手持火把攻击造成火焰伤害！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/hit.gif\" alt=\"主手攻击\"></li>\n<li>主手持工具、副手持火把攻击造成火焰伤害！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/tool-hit.gif\" alt=\"工具攻击\"></li>\n<li>若安装了 <strong>Soul Fire'd</strong>，灵魂火把可将怪物点燃灵魂火！<br>\n若未安装，灵魂火把点燃猪灵的火焰时间加倍，点燃其他生物增加2秒！</li>\n<li>若安装了 <strong>Copper Fire</strong>，铜火把可将怪物点燃铜火！<br>\n若未安装，铜火把点燃铜傀儡的火焰时间加倍，点燃其他生物增加1秒！</li>\n<li><strong>高度可配置！</strong> 详见下一章节。</li>\n</ul><h2><strong>配置</strong></h2><ul>\n<li>默认情况下，直接（主手）火把攻击造成4秒火焰伤害，与火焰附加 I 相同。<br>\n持续时长可配置。</li>\n<li>默认情况下，间接（副手）火把攻击功能已启用，可与任何工具配合，造成2秒火焰伤害。<br>\n持续时长、工具列表、对木质工具的伤害程度以及是否启用此功能均可配置。</li>\n<li>可将新物品设定为火把行为，默认包含最常见的模组火把。</li>\n<li>默认情况下，蜡烛也可用作火把！但用于攻击时会碎裂。<br>\n是否让蜡烛在攻击时碎裂以及是否启用此功能均可配置。</li>\n<li>默认情况下，火把和蜡烛总能点燃目标，仅蜡烛在使用后碎裂。<br>\n火把是否也应碎裂、点燃目标的概率以及物品是否可消耗均可配置。</li>\n<li>默认情况下，原版火把可用于造成火焰伤害。<br>\n若想调整游戏平衡，可禁止原版火把造成火焰伤害，仅允许配置中的额外物品生效。</li>\n<li>默认情况下，手持火把的怪物可点燃其他实体（包括玩家）。<br>\n此选项可禁用。</li>\n</ul><h2>🔗 <strong>依赖</strong></h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模组</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">加载器</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobweb</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config API Port</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Fabric</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Fire'd</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Fire</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prometheus</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">可选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>📜 <strong>许可与使用权利</strong></h2><p>欢迎在任何整合包或视频中使用此模组，只需注明出处并尽可能链接到<a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/torch-hit#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。<br>\n本项目采用 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/torch-hit/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest 社区许可 v1</a> 发布。</p><h2>❤️ <strong>支持我们</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest 网站\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"我们的其他项目\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%